# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Finder is fully functional with NO keys at all: it defaults to OpenStreetMap
# (Overpass + Nominatim), which covers the entire globe for free.
# Everything below is optional.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: enables the "Google Places" data source in the source switcher, and
# with it the only source of ratings, reviews and reliable store photos.
# Needs the Places API (New) enabled on the key. Nearby Search and Place
# Details are billed per request.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the Overpass instance (comma-separated list, tried in order).
# OVERPASS_ENDPOINTS=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter,https://overpass.kumi.systems/api/interpreter

# Optional: contact string sent in the User-Agent to OSM services, as their
# usage policy asks for. Set this to your own email/URL before heavy use.
# OSM_CONTACT=you@example.com

# Optional: use a different basemap provider for the street and dark styles.
# The default is OpenStreetMap's own tile service, which needs no key. Point
# these at CARTO, MapTiler, Stadia or similar if you want a nicer-looking map
# or expect enough traffic that OSM's tile usage policy matters.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_URL=https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png?api_key=YOUR_KEY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors &copy; CARTO
